---
kind: scene
luteVersion: "0.50.0"
character: hero
season: 1
episode: 1
title: Bounded jump
uses: ./schema.yaml
---

## Retry exhausted

::label{name="attempt"}
::set{run.tries += 1}
@hero: Attempt {{run.tries}}.
::jump{to="attempt" max="2"}
@narrator: Out of attempts.

## Left early by its guard

::label{name="again"}
::set{run.guarded += 1}
@hero: Round {{run.guarded}}.
::jump{to="again" max="5" when="run.guarded < 2"}
@narrator: The guard let go.

## Nested loops

::label{name="outer"}
::set{run.outer += 1}
::label{name="inner"}
::set{run.inner += 1}
@hero: Outer {{run.outer}}, inner {{run.inner}}.
::jump{to="inner" max="1"}
::jump{to="outer" max="1"}
@narrator: Both loops are done.

## Shared head

::label{name="shared"}
::set{run.shared += 1}
@hero: Shared {{run.shared}}.
::jump{to="shared" max="1"}
::jump{to="shared" max="1"}
@narrator: Both jumps are spent.

## Branch in a loop

::label{name="ask"}
::set{run.asks += 1}
<branch id="retry" prompt="Try again?">
  <choice id="yes" text="Yes">
    @hero: Once more.
    ::jump{to="ask" max="5"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="no" text="No">
    @hero: Enough.
  </choice>
</branch>

## Hub in a loop

::label{name="visit"}
::set{run.visits += 1}
<hub id="desk">
  <choice id="look" text="Look">
    @hero: Papers.
  </choice>
  <choice id="leave" text="Leave" exit>
    @hero: Leaving.
  </choice>
</hub>
::jump{to="visit" max="1"}

## Loop in a hub option

<hub id="bench">
  <choice id="train" text="Train">
    ::label{name="rep"}
    ::set{run.rounds += 1}
    @hero: Rep {{run.rounds}}.
    ::jump{to="rep" max="1"}
  </choice>
  <choice id="rest" text="Rest" exit>
    @hero: Resting.
  </choice>
</hub>
@narrator: The end.
